[
  {
    "id": "06ab9863-64b7-4dd7-9930-fb98c4787015",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "智慧文学中注重创造的神学倾向，并非巧合。人若想要明白人类生命的意义，他终究必会追本溯源。",
    "startOffset": 3950,
    "endOffset": 3994,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:15:55.337Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "57129fd2-a361-4ea4-84c0-f7490270c915",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "当人研读摩西五经时，可能很难感到个人在摩西五经中的重要性。而读历史书时，也可能只不过偶尔让他重温自己的信念，并对他所处的社会与世界投以关注而已。然而，在研读诗歌书时，他却随时可以发现自己身置其中。",
    "note": "诗篇中个人的重要性",
    "startOffset": 4067,
    "endOffset": 4165,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:17:04.452Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "08713125-c52d-4302-ab60-9f360473b075",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "约伯记、诗篇、箴言这三卷书特别归为一类。为了帮助记忆，他们称这三卷书为『真理之书』，因为在希伯来文里，这三卷书书名的第一个字母合起来就是『真理』（'emeth）。",
    "note": "真理之书",
    "startOffset": 4361,
    "endOffset": 4442,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:23:03.183Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "ba81fb8c-af17-43bf-8d8f-c3ad167043be",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "五卷诗歌书中的约伯记、箴言及传道书，被称为旧约智慧文学。",
    "note": "旧约智慧文学",
    "startOffset": 5283,
    "endOffset": 5311,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:23:55.654Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a39afd33-ebd2-487f-9c86-492165b190e2",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "在耶利米和以西结时代，智慧人与祭司和先知这两种宗教领袖并列：他们就说：「来罢！我们可以设计谋害耶利米，因为我们有祭司讲律法，智慧人设谋略，先知说豫言，都不能断绝。」(耶十八18；另参结七26)",
    "startOffset": 5788,
    "endOffset": 5887,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:26:09.166Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "ef04e862-889d-4a64-8037-36f44d975ec5",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "旧约众先知都承认，智慧乃是一种普遍的文学与宗教现象。",
    "note": "论点：旧约众先知都承认，智慧乃是一种普遍的文学与宗教现象。",
    "startOffset": 5492,
    "endOffset": 5518,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:27:11.518Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "94199aff-c803-45f5-ae03-798f6c56f521",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "技艺的智慧",
    "note": "论点智慧和有智慧的，也用来指称实用的技巧：设计、建造的巧匠",
    "startOffset": 5935,
    "endOffset": 5940,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:29:08.321Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2f3a768c-e976-4f81-8106-80af074dbb81",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "我们查考旧约中有关『智慧』(hochmah)这个名词和『有智慧的』(hāchām)这个形容词的经文时，我们发现它们亦用以指称实用的技艺。这些词汇用在设计、建造会幕的巧匠的身上：例如，建造会幕的比撒列（出卅五30～卅六1），为亚伦作圣衣的巧匠（出廿八3），以及纺线的妇女（出卅五25～26）等。",
    "startOffset": 5941,
    "endOffset": 6087,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:30:22.228Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "db549f5f-81b1-45c2-b754-aa67075a3140",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "它提供人类心灵一条表达真理的捷径。只需用几个字，就可使人想起一项真理",
    "startOffset": 6490,
    "endOffset": 6524,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:31:11.517Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "ca9d24d5-bea7-4f16-8651-b9657a9cdddd",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "谜语",
    "startOffset": 6674,
    "endOffset": 6676,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:31:48.647Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "04a134e5-dbff-4919-a8bd-ca6eb7630649",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "参孙曾用之难倒非利士人（士十四12～14），示巴女王也用难解的话试问所罗门（王上十1）。谜语的方法就是将一个观念隐晦起来，使听者感到困惑，或受到挑战而探索其中真义。",
    "startOffset": 6696,
    "endOffset": 6778,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:31:58.465Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "aa384a2b-8009-4dcc-8ecd-3f77f95a84be",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "简短有力的格言或警语",
    "startOffset": 6432,
    "endOffset": 6442,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:32:13.827Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "db0f60ae-fd3f-40da-afb9-a7ccd1220765",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "较长的文章",
    "startOffset": 6779,
    "endOffset": 6784,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:32:32.697Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d59735af-b7e9-4666-b8a9-4e4f000b03d7",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "因其表达方式变化多端，实非简略的格言或谜语所能及。比方说，敦亲睦邻之道就非格言的三言两语所能尽述。箴言三27～35即是一篇讨论此一论题的短文。然而这些长篇大论之中，往往也将格言形式纳入其中。",
    "startOffset": 6802,
    "endOffset": 6897,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:33:09.741Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9f253ed3-e315-43f1-880d-bb1f6eb25292",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "『智慧』这个字实与某类文学有关。旧约中的 māshāl 可广泛地用来指称一种格言、谜语，或是由对比、类比组成的较长句子。这字的动词意即『好像，正如』。",
    "startOffset": 6327,
    "endOffset": 6402,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:33:39.354Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b29cfc2-a21d-47b2-873f-6f31e6ddc109",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "文学的智慧",
    "note": "论点：『智慧』这个字实与某类文学有关。旧约中的 māshāl 可广泛地用来指称一种格言、谜语，或是由对比、类比组成的较长句子。",
    "startOffset": 6321,
    "endOffset": 6326,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:33:48.464Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "0fd5b705-f951-477e-a7aa-9e834927170a",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "智慧文学的对象是个人而非社会全体，因此国家利益反而变为次要。故与律法和先知书大相迳庭。",
    "startOffset": 6906,
    "endOffset": 6949,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:35:25.574Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "8a8248ab-34ed-4aef-9248-46cad835849a",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "但是由于智慧能指引个人幸福人生的方向，终久亦能增进社会幸福。",
    "startOffset": 7070,
    "endOffset": 7100,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:35:39.163Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b7e974a3-7890-40b6-9d7f-849a844a95ee",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "目的",
    "startOffset": 7106,
    "endOffset": 7108,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:36:13.132Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a632b4db-a8dd-4c7b-8d7f-4c3d2a281fed",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "指引青年如何达臻幸福人生",
    "startOffset": 7110,
    "endOffset": 7122,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:36:18.670Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "e97c3ec0-361f-4773-845d-c5b2108ed38c",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "智慧文学的对象乃是上流社会的青年",
    "startOffset": 7141,
    "endOffset": 7157,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:36:50.697Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "16faf50f-f87e-459a-8e9b-9e7e29856289",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "一般百姓虽然无法进入智慧学校，但也必深受智慧文学的吸引。",
    "startOffset": 7292,
    "endOffset": 7320,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:37:47.780Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c9807979-a5f2-45ca-a557-a58baf6ae466",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "智慧文学已在家庭中广为应用",
    "startOffset": 7618,
    "endOffset": 7631,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:38:50.909Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a7ca429b-8c0d-4964-aaed-ead5c46498f7",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "在王国时期，很可能文士与智慧人关系密切，有时根本就是二而一的事。被掳归回之后，文士就是智慧教师。",
    "startOffset": 7781,
    "endOffset": 7829,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:39:28.004Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "499ee5d4-afe1-4ad0-b5de-34bbaeba1dc3",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "智慧文学的对象",
    "note": "论点：智慧文学的对象是：个人而非社会全体、上流社会的青年、一般百姓。",
    "startOffset": 6898,
    "endOffset": 6905,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:40:31.943Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "14a7ee9a-8e33-4fd7-a468-4645a0f18dbc",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "宫廷乃是智慧思想的学府。那么，智慧与圣殿和礼仪又有什么关系呢？",
    "startOffset": 7846,
    "endOffset": 7877,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:41:15.777Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "ebf363da-7079-4fbf-acc7-f1de74fa5653",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "温拉德",
    "startOffset": 7877,
    "endOffset": 7880,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:42:04.823Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "58775daf-e0e0-46bf-9dc8-235bb14dbc2b",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "智慧系由以色列宗教制度中衍生",
    "startOffset": 7892,
    "endOffset": 7906,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:42:11.347Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "49d1380e-cf2b-4ded-a429-29438e325698",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "麦肯（William McKane）却辩称",
    "startOffset": 8009,
    "endOffset": 8030,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:42:17.593Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "dd77bb44-5d18-4a1d-bcf5-a7212209dbd0",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "智慧人乃是政治家或官员，他的『智谋』不局限于宗教方面",
    "startOffset": 8031,
    "endOffset": 8057,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:42:27.529Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "f512416a-c145-4f75-9655-abe149a66263",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "智慧的运作范围是非礼仪性的",
    "startOffset": 8106,
    "endOffset": 8119,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:42:51.133Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "0092b89d-715f-4958-9105-e74001c2cc4d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "我们必须同意温拉德的看法：即使在被掳以前，智慧的基本要素仍是『敬畏神』。仅俱世俗特性的智慧，实在无法维系一个圣俗紧密相关的社会。纵使圣殿和祭司制度并未产生智慧运动，但是他们并不反对智慧。由于智慧强调遵行诫命，敬爱真神，并且信守律法，因此智慧对宗教制度而言，实系扮演着支持的角色。",
    "startOffset": 8122,
    "endOffset": 8261,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:43:39.578Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "e79b8d5c-2099-4004-8d8c-bd48445f9a97",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "智慧与圣殿礼仪",
    "note": "论点：赞同温拉德的看法，智慧由以色列宗教制度中衍生，且正好弥补礼仪的不足（圣殿和祭司们不太关心智慧）",
    "startOffset": 7830,
    "endOffset": 7837,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:45:40.780Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "ac7516d0-33d4-4a37-ba11-ec6f268e3854",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "当智慧企图僭越耶和华的话语之时，先知即与智慧发生冲突。",
    "startOffset": 8312,
    "endOffset": 8339,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:47:05.277Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "7293f757-5997-4fd7-b768-2ccef5e6e3df",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "当百姓与祭司坚持献祭本身可以换取救赎之时，先知亦曾大张挞伐",
    "startOffset": 8351,
    "endOffset": 8380,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:47:12.598Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "05701b72-203b-4989-8632-2830e43aec56",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "然而，事实上先知均认为智慧乃出于神（赛廿八23～29；耶十12），并且他们也采用智慧文学的写作风格（例如使用格言方式——赛四九24；耶十三12；十五12；十三28；卅一29；结十六44；十八2，且词汇相同）",
    "startOffset": 8440,
    "endOffset": 8543,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:47:24.090Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "14ff659e-531a-4a25-8012-c24a41b1418c",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "可见先知并非全然排斥智慧。",
    "startOffset": 8552,
    "endOffset": 8565,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:47:29.812Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2c62740e-def2-4b41-8c26-d5aae4ee25fc",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "智慧与先知",
    "note": "论点：当智慧要僭越耶和华的话，先知会何其发生冲突，但是先知也并非全然排斥智慧，承认智慧出于神",
    "startOffset": 8263,
    "endOffset": 8268,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:48:51.465Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "8d7210c9-457e-4fc7-8923-6ff64a5400ca",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "旧约诗歌书中的约伯记、箴言、传道书，常被列为『智慧』书，此种分类是有其道理的。",
    "startOffset": 8618,
    "endOffset": 8657,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:50:47.994Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "4886795d-3ab8-4a98-b0f4-5cd101fef248",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "约伯记",
    "startOffset": 8657,
    "endOffset": 8660,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:50:57.386Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "7c20ec46-109f-4383-a35b-13dde6446064",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "人类对于公正问题的困惑，并且追问公正与个人环境、个人命运之间有何关系？作者提出神的公正是否存在的问题，并从几个不同的角度来探讨这问题。这种文学常被称作高等的或沈思的智慧（higher or reflective wisdom）",
    "startOffset": 8663,
    "endOffset": 8776,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:51:10.309Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "3114512e-13fd-455d-89b1-159bd38b61f2",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "传道书",
    "startOffset": 8777,
    "endOffset": 8780,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:51:21.154Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a1cc9d13-40dc-4c5a-9410-a7eeb666f027",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "十分强调生命意义的问题。",
    "startOffset": 8797,
    "endOffset": 8809,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:51:40.424Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d0f23154-965c-417c-b886-6635e349a4ea",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "约伯记（一1，9；二3；廿八28）和传道书（三14；十二13）均含有智慧文学的基本要素——敬畏神。",
    "startOffset": 9139,
    "endOffset": 9188,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:52:00.113Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "1fd976f7-d1b3-4490-a8f9-4eee733e14ee",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "箴言",
    "startOffset": 9201,
    "endOffset": 9203,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:52:17.484Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "7b1ed33f-5ff1-4097-8992-243e187d73ef",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "又称作较低的智慧（lower wisdom）",
    "startOffset": 9215,
    "endOffset": 9237,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:52:25.964Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "63706821-b1aa-4722-ab56-32cf42dbf4af",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "箴言与约伯记、传道书有着相同的神学前题——敬畏神（一7；九10；十五33）。",
    "startOffset": 9250,
    "endOffset": 9288,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:52:39.844Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "51f8e2fa-7273-49b7-bca2-03d53aca842a",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "诗篇",
    "startOffset": 9402,
    "endOffset": 9404,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:54:28.087Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9892f928-76ba-43f3-bc1c-f0fa8e86c003",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "诗篇流露出一种个人敬虔的精神，并且强调个人及其生命",
    "startOffset": 9901,
    "endOffset": 9926,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:54:47.273Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c046d6da-d657-42b0-8c49-df791b1be54e",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "诗篇虽然不全属于智慧文学，但其中一部份的确具有智慧文学的内涵与精神",
    "startOffset": 10051,
    "endOffset": 10084,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:55:13.437Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c1aee58e-77d9-4875-987e-ebf95158e8a6",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "雅歌",
    "startOffset": 10093,
    "endOffset": 10095,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:55:19.235Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b350fd70-9d5a-44cc-a8ab-0a4504d27f2a",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "雅歌的文学形式确实属于智慧文学的范畴",
    "startOffset": 10164,
    "endOffset": 10182,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:55:51.127Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "62760887-e9b2-45bd-8819-b2f0ee1aa836",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "雅歌书中没有明显地谈论其他智慧书中所共有的敬畏神与个人正义等主题",
    "startOffset": 10273,
    "endOffset": 10305,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:56:15.510Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "e3f2eba9-6d5f-4a24-8425-2f7a165ecbc1",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "它的文学形式（歌曲）及目的，仍是教诲性质的",
    "startOffset": 10308,
    "endOffset": 10329,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:56:26.989Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "43a2cf6c-8fbd-41d6-b7b3-956b15402174",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "研读雅歌时即可发现，这卷书赞扬美德和坚贞，与智慧文学有着相同的主题",
    "startOffset": 10355,
    "endOffset": 10388,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:56:46.614Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "171c07fb-4b75-4fbe-8434-393a70621fbf",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "诗歌书与智慧",
    "note": "论点：介绍诗歌书，其中约伯记、箴言、传道书被列为【智慧书】。对五卷书简要分析。",
    "startOffset": 8566,
    "endOffset": 8572,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:58:00.061Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bdedb1f3-ac91-4c11-b762-d49cb773e044",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "深受异文化交流所带来的实惠与弊害。了解以色列与近东同源文学之间，文学类型与观念之共通性，非但不会贬低旧约圣经的信仰，反而更增加我们对旧约的欣赏。",
    "startOffset": 10524,
    "endOffset": 10596,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T14:59:35.254Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "26881068-87a5-438b-bf92-8ff3f20754a3",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "了解其他文学的赞美诗，对于我们研究诗篇会有很大的帮助",
    "startOffset": 11419,
    "endOffset": 11445,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:01:42.750Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "3d6d3d6d-10fb-400f-b89a-a0c94c3d5e61",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "圣经希伯来文最相近的乌加列语，成为研究诗篇不可或缺的重要参考资料，因为它较巴比伦文和埃及文更为接近希伯来文",
    "startOffset": 12998,
    "endOffset": 13051,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:03:18.055Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a930d394-ec51-4183-a551-96b9aeb6c19d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "赞美诗",
    "note": "论点：了解其他文学的赞美诗，对我们研究诗篇会有很大的帮助。\n内容：对比了几处其他文学的赞美诗和诗篇的赞美诗。",
    "startOffset": 11384,
    "endOffset": 11387,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:04:02.005Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "5410b312-40ff-4a99-a752-f0417328a737",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "格言及较长的文章，或训诲，亦在同源文学中被发现",
    "startOffset": 13419,
    "endOffset": 13442,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:05:07.707Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "12d531a1-f742-45b5-8d68-00fdeb812423",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "为甚么只有极少的巴比伦格言存留下来？蓝伯特以为，虽然我们从许多证据确知，巴比伦人和亚述人的日常对话中，格言十分流行，但是在文学中，格言却不普遍。",
    "startOffset": 14125,
    "endOffset": 14197,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:06:14.855Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d962dbaf-08e1-494f-b818-131d0c7c6320",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "箴言的诗体形式，在许多地方都与乌加列史诗中的诗体形式相似。 $^{31}$ 此外，箴言中有许多字汇和同义字，都出现在乌加列文件中。",
    "startOffset": 14241,
    "endOffset": 14306,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:06:33.544Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "6b9efd2a-c2e6-4f52-81f5-6257ea092885",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "格言",
    "note": "论点：格言及较长的文章、训诲在同源文学中被发现。\n内容：不同的格言、较长的文章、训诲和圣经中的对比",
    "startOffset": 13334,
    "endOffset": 13336,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:07:51.973Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c01827d9-a503-4070-9ca7-95c933d658fc",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "即使有了上述这些文学实例，我们仍然无法在这些文学当中，找到与旧约沈思文学相同的信仰，和深邃的思想。虽然圣经文学是那样多采多姿，但其基本的独一神思想，却弥漫在圣经文学的每一部份，而最根本之约的道德，又为圣经文学一切观念和教训的基础。",
    "startOffset": 17480,
    "endOffset": 17595,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:08:37.393Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "bd74a238-f604-4fd7-a2ff-83913643bfe0",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "诗歌书中，约伯记和传道书深具沈思的特性。虽然智慧文学中大多数的文学都属实用性质，但也有不少属于沈思性质的问题",
    "startOffset": 14544,
    "endOffset": 14598,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:09:08.990Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "aaa6f899-71eb-47ab-9eb2-81672ea51f06",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "埃及迄今尚未发现任何有关沈思性质的文件，而巴比伦却有丰富的沈思文学",
    "startOffset": 14599,
    "endOffset": 14632,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:09:20.449Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b940af9e-8111-4533-888c-462ff0e47073",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "沈思文学",
    "note": "论点：巴比伦沈思文学\n内容巴比伦沈思文学和圣经中内容对比",
    "startOffset": 14539,
    "endOffset": 14543,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:10:41.034Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a0a58d22-e8d8-406b-a38f-9d0b49ae8e1d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "次经中的智慧",
    "note": "待读",
    "startOffset": 17596,
    "endOffset": 17602,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:12:24.179Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "6664c0d9-2b64-4fad-b869-d9b1ce17171f",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "希伯来诗歌",
    "note": "待读",
    "startOffset": 19668,
    "endOffset": 19673,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:12:32.854Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b46330bf-a1d3-4778-b05f-dda378aaeef2",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "由于智慧书的内容丰富广博，实难以区区数页篇幅尽述其神学全貌。然而，我们若能窥其神学轮廓，即能对此一广大的智慧领域有较深入的了解。",
    "startOffset": 27827,
    "endOffset": 27891,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:19:27.957Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d9329c34-4674-4eb9-a5cf-8fbe18249e38",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "虽然有些学者极力主张，最早的希伯来智慧文学是完全世俗的， $^{1}$ 然而即使是其中最独断的言论，也很难叫人相信，像这样",
    "startOffset": 28363,
    "endOffset": 28424,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:23:06.858Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2e16ffde-e58d-4c04-ae45-18f795bf2424",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "自然启示",
    "startOffset": 28717,
    "endOffset": 28721,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:23:25.810Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "37027edb-8255-4425-99a7-4b0b7e4c1707",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "我们不应妄下断语，说其中没有『特殊启示』",
    "startOffset": 28725,
    "endOffset": 28745,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:23:34.858Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2d80ae3b-4cbe-4439-b12f-a489b638c3c8",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "在少数情况下，甚至神也会直接向人说话，例如约伯记中的智慧诗（廿八28）以及神的讲论（卅八1～四二6）。",
    "startOffset": 28800,
    "endOffset": 28851,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:23:55.292Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "c174657c-20f5-4b81-9992-e1f23494d89e",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "在圣经智慧文学中，我们看见神的基本属性之一，就是创造的权能与活动（伯廿八23，25～27；卅八4～卅九30；箴三19～20；八22～34）",
    "startOffset": 28971,
    "endOffset": 29040,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:25:52.448Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "1670f96b-011f-445c-acaa-7a5a15b74204",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "末世论不是智慧文学所关心的问题",
    "startOffset": 29119,
    "endOffset": 29134,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:26:01.818Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "3572e0d0-5f78-4319-9d1f-11ae1da710e8",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "世界和人类的生命是怎么来的？",
    "startOffset": 29074,
    "endOffset": 29088,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:26:13.800Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2f78fac5-60bc-4b2e-867c-6118ecb719e8",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "虽然智慧文学并未清楚描述救赎的思想，但是智慧文学在旧约神学中所提供的神学素材，亦补足了律法与先知的救赎内容",
    "startOffset": 29400,
    "endOffset": 29453,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:27:06.018Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "45c78e45-7339-4d8e-8b95-a8ee72e04ebf",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "神是创造者",
    "note": "论点：圣经智慧文学中，神的基本属性之一，创造的全能与活动",
    "startOffset": 28965,
    "endOffset": 28970,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:27:56.589Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "51f072d6-a177-43b5-893f-74f7b3e9e7ea",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "智慧就是宇宙存在的基本原理（rationale of the cosmos）",
    "startOffset": 29508,
    "endOffset": 29546,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:28:24.295Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "4a8bef9c-bd1f-416a-99e2-2262857c1d19",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "智慧是神在创世以前就有的沛然之力，充塞在宇宙和人类的社会制度中（箴二1～15；八22）。智慧是写在大自然和人类经验中之神的道（God's Word）。",
    "startOffset": 29619,
    "endOffset": 29694,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:29:09.746Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "6409cdd7-72ed-4cba-8c77-258ef5a09e62",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "神是智慧的源头",
    "note": "论点：神是智慧的源头",
    "startOffset": 29462,
    "endOffset": 29469,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:29:37.518Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9a7529a6-8a19-4a07-91f0-b1363fbe2751",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "约伯记认为，敬畏耶和华就是智慧（廿八28）；而有些经文则表明，敬畏耶和华是『智慧的开端』（诗一一一10；箴九10；参箴一7；十五33）。",
    "startOffset": 30036,
    "endOffset": 30104,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:30:50.495Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "f5267295-528b-4e8e-b0ce-78957191b783",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "人与智慧之间的动态关系可以『敬畏耶和华』的形式来表达。这乃是一种个人与神之间的关系，因智慧文学描述个人与神相遇的光景。",
    "startOffset": 29894,
    "endOffset": 29953,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:31:07.860Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "e337586e-f42d-4131-8c5f-c927e0adef4c",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "敬畏耶和华不仅是一种达到目的的手段，它本身就是目的，与神、人和世界和谐相处，共享美善的生活。",
    "startOffset": 30281,
    "endOffset": 30327,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:31:21.940Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "824a3a3b-fe2d-495c-96ab-72da92247c2e",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "敬畏耶和华与智慧",
    "note": "论点：敬畏耶和华与智慧",
    "startOffset": 29885,
    "endOffset": 29893,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:31:32.702Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "71a67f3d-0da1-4431-a80f-251bfe7bf143",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "智慧文学的对象，乃是社会结构中最小的单位——个人",
    "startOffset": 30336,
    "endOffset": 30360,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:33:10.890Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "9004ac96-7b8a-4780-8ef4-bb04ee271c2d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "因人是神的杰作，具有理智与意志，并要对他在世界上的行为负完全的责任。人必须肩负起他自己的责任，他如何接受这个挑战，就决定了他一生的命运。因此，人性的弱点，诸如懒惰、贪婪、浪费资源等，都应予以革除，因为这些坏习性都会拦阻人类克尽个人职责，善用人类天赋才能。智慧文学呼吁人类发挥潜能，不允许人类逃避责任。",
    "startOffset": 30449,
    "endOffset": 30599,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:33:22.979Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "43bbd0aa-c3ca-428c-9a23-5aae1bd0d2a3",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "个人责任",
    "startOffset": 30607,
    "endOffset": 30611,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:33:46.965Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "33e000a5-c49f-4054-b236-8482e22feb12",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "我们不可说，智慧哲人因为强调个人责任，所以就排斥共同责任",
    "startOffset": 30828,
    "endOffset": 30856,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:34:16.806Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "98285069-c629-462c-ba51-81730d5aabd7",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "个人主义",
    "note": "论点：个人责任",
    "startOffset": 30331,
    "endOffset": 30335,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:34:36.279Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "78fb04cc-7860-4854-97a1-4035b8fd26f5",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "人类全体",
    "startOffset": 30974,
    "endOffset": 30978,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:35:08.375Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a736bca0-2823-4790-baab-8809561e3295",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "约伯记就是一个很好的例子。约伯记从个人的沈思默想（特别是约伯记三章，这也是第一循环头两回合对话的主要语调一六～七；九～十）开始，进而转到将个人进退维谷的困境，应用到全人类的身上（伯十四1～22）",
    "startOffset": 30979,
    "endOffset": 31076,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:35:30.005Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "4e276f3f-c63a-4bae-82bd-6b790647f9d8",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "这位信心的英雄由他个人的悲剧出发，结果发现他的悲剧广泛地发生在全人类的身上",
    "startOffset": 31175,
    "endOffset": 31212,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:35:51.692Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "d16aaaa2-087d-4b4f-82f2-eb80f17c2c4b",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "七1～2",
    "startOffset": 31127,
    "endOffset": 31131,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:36:00.251Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "370ab4a4-224c-4a40-bea3-979939d48027",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "（七3～10）",
    "startOffset": 31161,
    "endOffset": 31168,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:36:05.494Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "3f09c9bc-2d61-4f21-962b-ae1a6a6ef111",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "看到全人类的困境",
    "startOffset": 31236,
    "endOffset": 31244,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:36:19.968Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "2a6b15d4-c0f4-4eaf-a0bb-010ca464608f",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "开始探索时，乃是用一个普通的名词『人』（adām）：人一切的劳碌，就是他在日光之下的劳碌，有甚么益处呢？ （传一3）",
    "startOffset": 31249,
    "endOffset": 31308,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:36:38.021Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "36ac50c3-fc1f-4d21-997b-b5f2b24182e0",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "当他结束探索时，人类的命运仍浮现在他脑际：『因为人归他永远的家，吊丧的在街上往来』（十二5）。",
    "startOffset": 31309,
    "endOffset": 31356,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:37:01.870Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "0fb463eb-9919-4b3a-a118-d330eccdc9d1",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#86efac",
    "text": "这种将个人的困境引申到全人类的困境，乃是沈思智慧（约伯记与传道书）的特性，实用的智慧（箴言）则不是这样。",
    "startOffset": 31359,
    "endOffset": 31411,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:37:15.748Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "28b4537b-47e7-4ca7-acb2-f0bc0c067fc9",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#c4b5fd",
    "text": "圣经智慧书看人，不只看个人，也看整体，正如圣经明言：『要生养众多，遍满地面，治理这地。也要管理海里的鱼，空中的鸟，和地上各样行动的活物。』（创一28）他怎样接受并执行这个责任，就决定了他的命运。",
    "startOffset": 31446,
    "endOffset": 31543,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:37:44.827Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "67bc19e4-9ba3-41be-8be1-7f933682cafa",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "人类",
    "note": "论点：智慧文学也关注人类全体和整体",
    "startOffset": 30943,
    "endOffset": 30945,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:38:27.082Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "a75ac9f2-1185-4f79-90af-e235923d138d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "报应式的公正",
    "startOffset": 31559,
    "endOffset": 31565,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:39:08.027Z",
    "note": "强调一：报应式的公正"
  },
  {
    "id": "6e51f96c-520c-4033-8e3a-4dbd8f01a8ce",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "纪林（Gelin）将报应原则的理论发展，分成三个阶段：(1)集体与今生；(2)个别与今生；(3)个别与来生。他并认为，这三个阶段依历史演变渐次发展而来。",
    "startOffset": 31634,
    "endOffset": 31710,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:39:36.161Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "e22b14f7-e63e-4749-a621-5450d9954184",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "这三种模式在旧约思想史中，往往重叠存在着",
    "startOffset": 31763,
    "endOffset": 31783,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:39:57.585Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "40ef68f6-fb24-4cab-828d-eddaa7cf9562",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "第一种模式在智慧文学中并不普遍，原因是智慧书着重个人。但在摩西五经中则有很好的例证，例如出廿5～6清楚说道：『因为我耶和华你的神是忌邪的神，恨我的，我必追讨他的罪，自父及子，直到三四代。爱我守我诫命的，我必向他们发慈爱，直到千代。』",
    "note": "第一种模式",
    "startOffset": 31804,
    "endOffset": 31920,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:43:10.166Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "5705e4a5-71a3-466e-8fc7-8bb05f5fc7a1",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "第二种模式，个别与今生，是圣经智慧书中最普遍的模式。",
    "note": "第二种模式",
    "startOffset": 31921,
    "endOffset": 31947,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:44:40.654Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "6ce7c40d-ce58-4472-b795-a9af89100f60",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "有罪必罚，罚必因刑",
    "note": "第二种模式，分类一：有罪必罚，罚必因刑",
    "startOffset": 32010,
    "endOffset": 32019,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:45:10.565Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "b59297dc-ae1c-4600-b73c-a6ff0a86d66b",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "受苦未必就是犯罪的结果",
    "note": "第二种观点，分类二：受苦未必就是犯罪的结果",
    "startOffset": 32151,
    "endOffset": 32162,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:46:10.139Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "91643713-1d12-4619-ab12-525fd233bc02",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "第三种模式，个别与来生，可以诗篇四十九篇为例。诗人确信，神会拯救他脱离阴间（Sheol）的权势（15节）。约伯也时时刻刻抱持这种想法：我这皮肉灭绝之后，我必在肉体之外得见神。 (伯十九26)这理论到所罗门智训时，更被肯定且十分发达（三8，9，14；四7～18；五16；九15）。此一深受重视又有价值的观念，逐渐成为报应式公正思想体系的主流，并且深植于新约圣经中。",
    "note": "第三种模式：逐渐成为报应公正思想体系的主流，并且深植于新约圣经中",
    "startOffset": 32690,
    "endOffset": 32874,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:47:26.950Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "881ebec2-6a53-43b2-b4be-142189b67cc7",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "普世性",
    "note": "强调二：普世性",
    "startOffset": 32875,
    "endOffset": 32878,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:49:37.025Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "8f147b68-7456-4c88-b8e5-921afec92c5c",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "highlight",
    "color": "#f8b4b4",
    "text": "智慧文学之所以具有普世性质，很可能系因智慧的方法使然：从社会中最小的单位开始，由下而上发生影响。",
    "startOffset": 32895,
    "endOffset": 32943,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:49:47.089Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "f4728a37-abba-4f11-b5d1-b295d4399f8d",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "律法",
    "note": "强调三：律法",
    "startOffset": 33250,
    "endOffset": 33252,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:50:01.455Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "5981d680-3058-408e-a828-842c6dbe182e",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "历史。圣经智慧文学不强调世界历史事件，而强调大自然与道德的普世秩序",
    "startOffset": 33360,
    "endOffset": 33393,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:50:48.022Z",
    "note": "非强调一：历史，不强调历史，而强调大自然与道德的普世秩序"
  },
  {
    "id": "57c79b45-44c3-4cd5-90f5-566d714724a6",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "礼仪。以色列宗教的国族特性，在智慧书中仅居次要地位（如：约、拣选、律法等），因此国家宗教规条在智慧书中亦不曾强调。",
    "note": "非强调二：礼仪",
    "startOffset": 33503,
    "endOffset": 33560,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:52:09.438Z"
  },
  {
    "id": "1a75e188-bfed-4523-a2f6-961ab02f316a",
    "bookId": "e5c7ba94-9e73-4f82-8c33-33a51dacf5d9",
    "type": "thought",
    "color": "#93c5fd",
    "text": "神的怜恤。智慧书中较少提到神的怜恤",
    "note": "非强调三：神的怜悯",
    "startOffset": 33774,
    "endOffset": 33791,
    "createdAt": "2026-09-19T15:52:50.582Z"
  },
  {
